  <p>"I know it's raining, but what does the road actually look like?" That's why nationwide road CCTV is built into the same app. Satellite, then radar, then CCTV — the pre-departure decision ends in one app.</p>
  <ul class="checks">
    <li><strong>CCTV markers</strong> over precipitation radar — tap a camera in the rainy zone</li>
    <li><strong>Several nearby cameras as small videos at once</strong> on one map</li>
    <li>Tap a marker for a single live feed; <strong>Jeju roads</strong> have their own channel</li>
  </ul>
{% endcall %}

